<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Hub Fun! Studio | Hub Fun!</title>
  <meta
    name="description"
    content="Hub Fun! Studioが開発する、推し活をもっと楽しく、もっと便利にするアプリ Hub Fun! の公式サイトです。"
  >

  <style>
    :root {
      --pink: #ff6fae;
      --yellow: #ffd95a;
      --mint: #67d9c4;
      --blue: #70b7ff;
      --purple: #9b8cff;
      --dark: #34323b;
      --text: #4a4852;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --bg: #fffafc;
      --card: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
      --shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(70, 50, 80, 0.10);
      --radius: 24px;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      font-family:
        -apple-system,
        BlinkMacSystemFont,
        "Noto Sans JP",
        "Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN",
        "Yu Gothic",
        sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 10% 10%, rgba(255,111,174,.14), transparent 25%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 90% 15%, rgba(112,183,255,.15), transparent 25%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 100%, rgba(103,217,196,.14), transparent 30%),
        var(--bg);
      line-height: 1.8;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    /* =========================
       Header
    ========================= */

    header {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      z-index: 100;
      padding: 14px 24px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.78);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.7);
    }

    .nav {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: auto;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: .03em;
      color: var(--dark);
    }

    .logo span {
      color: var(--pink);
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 22px;
      font-size: .9rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      transition: .2s;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover {
      color: var(--pink);
    }

    /* =========================
       Hero
    ========================= */

    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 150px 24px 90px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      position: relative;
    }

    .hero-inner {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr .9fr;
      gap: 70px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 7px 15px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #fff;
      color: var(--pink);
      font-size: .85rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5.8rem);
      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: -.04em;
      color: var(--dark);
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .hero h1 .hub {
      color: var(--pink);
    }

    .hero h1 .fun {
      color: var(--purple);
    }

    .hero-copy {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #66636e;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      max-width: 600px;
    }

    .hero-buttons {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 52px;
      padding: 0 24px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-weight: 800;
      transition: transform .2s, box-shadow .2s;
    }

    .button:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
    }

    .button-primary {
      color: #fff;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--pink), var(--purple));
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(155,140,255,.28);
    }

    .button-secondary {
      background: #fff;
      color: var(--dark);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    /* =========================
       Hero visual
    ========================= */

    .hero-visual {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 450px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .blob {
      position: absolute;
      width: 330px;
      height: 330px;
      border-radius: 45% 55% 60% 40% / 55% 45% 55% 45%;
      background: linear-gradient(
        135deg,
        #ffd8e8,
        #ddd7ff,
        #c9f5ed
      );
      animation: blob 8s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    @keyframes blob {
      0%,100% {
        border-radius: 45% 55% 60% 40% / 55% 45% 55% 45%;
        transform: rotate(0deg);
      }
      50% {
        border-radius: 60% 40% 45% 55% / 40% 60% 45% 55%;
        transform: rotate(8deg);
      }
    }

    .phone {
      position: relative;
      width: 230px;
      height: 460px;
      padding: 10px;
      border-radius: 36px;
      background: #292832;
      box-shadow:
        0 30px 60px rgba(50,40,70,.25),
        0 0 0 8px rgba(255,255,255,.5);
      transform: rotate(4deg);
    }

    .phone-screen {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      border-radius: 27px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: linear-gradient(160deg, #fff8fb, #f3f0ff);
      padding: 22px 15px;
    }

    .phone-title {
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--dark);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .mini-card {
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 11px;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(70,50,80,.08);
    }

    .mini-icon {
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-right: 8px;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .pink { background: #ffdce9; }
    .yellow { background: #fff0ae; }
    .mint { background: #d5f6ee; }
    .blue { background: #dcecff; }

    .mini-text {
      display: inline-block;
      vertical-align: top;
      font-size: .78rem;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .mini-text small {
      display: block;
      color: #99949e;
      font-size: .65rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .floating {
      position: absolute;
      padding: 13px 17px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: #fff;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      font-size: .82rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .floating.one {
      top: 55px;
      right: 5px;
      color: var(--pink);
    }

    .floating.two {
      bottom: 55px;
      left: 5px;
      color: var(--mint);
      animation-delay: -2s;
    }

    @keyframes float {
      0%,100% { transform: translateY(0); }
      50% { transform: translateY(-10px); }
    }

    /* =========================
       Sections
    ========================= */

    section {
      padding: 100px 24px;
    }

    .section-inner {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    .section-heading {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 55px;
    }

    .section-heading .label {
      color: var(--pink);
      font-size: .82rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: .12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .section-heading h2 {
      margin-top: 8px;
      color: var(--dark);
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
      line-height: 1.25;
    }

    .section-heading p {
      margin: 15px auto 0;
      max-width: 650px;
      color: #77737d;
    }

    /* =========================
       Concept
    ========================= */

    .concept {
      position: relative;
    }

    .concept-box {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.85);
      border-radius: 32px;
      padding: 55px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .concept-box .big-copy {
      font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--dark);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .concept-box .big-copy span {
      color: var(--pink);
    }

    .concept-box p {
      max-width: 750px;
      margin: auto;
      color: #6f6b75;
    }

    /* =========================
       Features
    ========================= */

    .features {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .feature {
      padding: 30px 23px;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: #fff;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      transition: transform .2s;
    }

    .feature:hover {
      transform: translateY(-6px);
    }

    .feature-icon {
      width: 62px;
      height: 62px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.7rem;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .feature:nth-child(1) .feature-icon {
      background: #ffe0ec;
    }

    .feature:nth-child(2) .feature-icon {
      background: #fff1b8;
    }

    .feature:nth-child(3) .feature-icon {
      background: #d8f6ef;
    }

    .feature:nth-child(4) .feature-icon {
      background: #dcecff;
    }

    .feature h3 {
      color: var(--dark);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .feature p {
      font-size: .9rem;
      color: #77737d;
    }

    /* =========================
       Studio
    ========================= */

    .studio-card {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 50px;
      border-radius: 32px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          rgba(255,255,255,.95),
          rgba(250,246,255,.95)
        );
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .studio-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 7px 14px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #efeaff;
      color: #7665d9;
      font-size: .8rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .studio-card h2 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      color: var(--dark);
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .studio-card p {
      color: #77737d;
    }

    .studio-message {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 250px;
      border-radius: 28px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%, #ffd8e8 0 13%, transparent 14%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 70%, #d8f6ef 0 15%, transparent 16%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 60% 25%, #dcecff 0 10%, transparent 11%),
        #fff;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .studio-message strong {
      font-size: 2.1rem;
      color: var(--dark);
      text-align: center;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .studio-message strong span {
      color: var(--pink);
    }

    /* =========================
       CTA
    ========================= */

    .cta {
      padding-bottom: 110px;
    }

    .cta-box {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      padding: 70px 30px;
      border-radius: 36px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #fff;
      background: linear-gradient(
        135deg,
        #ff76b3,
        #9b8cff
      );
      box-shadow: 0 25px 60px rgba(155,140,255,.25);
    }

    .cta-box::before,
    .cta-box::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      width: 180px;
      height: 180px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.12);
    }

    .cta-box::before {
      left: -60px;
      top: -70px;
    }

    .cta-box::after {
      right: -50px;
      bottom: -80px;
    }

    .cta-box h2 {
      position: relative;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.3rem);
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .cta-box p {
      position: relative;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      opacity: .92;
    }

    .cta-box .button {
      position: relative;
      background: #fff;
      color: #6f61c9;
    }

    /* =========================
       Footer
    ========================= */

    footer {
      padding: 35px 24px;
      background: #302e37;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.72);
    }

    .footer-inner {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: auto;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .footer-logo {
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .footer-logo span {
      color: #ff82b9;
    }

    .footer-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 20px;
      font-size: .82rem;
    }

    .footer-links a:hover {
      color: #fff;
    }

    .copyright {
      font-size: .75rem;
      opacity: .55;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    /* =========================
       Responsive
    ========================= */

    @media (max-width: 850px) {
      .nav-links {
        display: none;
      }

      .hero-inner {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        text-align: center;
        gap: 30px;
      }

      .hero-copy {
        margin-left: auto;
        margin-right: auto;
      }

      .hero-buttons {
        justify-content: center;
      }

      .hero-visual {
        min-height: 430px;
      }

      .features {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }

      .studio-card {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        padding: 35px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      header {
        padding: 12px 18px;
      }

      .hero {
        padding-top: 120px;
      }

      section {
        padding: 75px 18px;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 3.5rem;
      }

      .hero-visual {
        transform: scale(.88);
        min-height: 390px;
        margin-top: -15px;
      }

      .features {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .concept-box,
      .studio-card {
        padding: 28px 22px;
      }

      .footer-inner {
        flex-direction: column;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .footer-links {
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        justify-content: center;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <!-- =========================
       Header
  ========================== -->

  <header>
    <nav class="nav">
      <a href="#" class="logo">
        Hub <span>Fun!</span>
      </a>

      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#features">Hub Fun!</a>
        <a href="#studio">Studio</a>
        <a href="#download">Download</a>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </header>


  <!-- =========================
       Hero
  ========================== -->

  <main>

    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-inner">

        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">
            Hub Fun! Studio
          </div>

          <h1>
            <span class="hub">Hub</span><br>
            <span class="fun">Fun!</span>
          </h1>

          <p class="hero-copy">
            推し活を、もっと楽しく。<br>
            あちこちに散らばった「好きな情報」を、
            ひとつの場所へ。
          </p>

          <div class="hero-buttons">
            <!-- Google Play公開後にURLを変更 -->
            <a href="#download" class="button button-primary">
              Hub Fun! を見る →
            </a>

            <a href="#about" class="button button-secondary">
              Hub Fun! について
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>


        <!-- アプリのイメージ -->
        <div class="hero-visual">

          <div class="blob"></div>

          <div class="floating one">
            ✨ 好きなものをまとめよう
          </div>

          <div class="floating two">
            💕 推し活をもっと楽しく
          </div>

          <div class="phone">
            <div class="phone-screen">

              <div class="phone-title">
                Hub Fun!
              </div>

              <div class="mini-card">
                <span class="mini-icon pink">♡</span>
                <span class="mini-text">
                  推し
                  <small>好きな人・作品をまとめる</small>
                </span>
              </div>

              <div class="mini-card">
                <span class="mini-icon yellow">★</span>
                <span class="mini-text">
                  イベント
                  <small>予定をチェック</small>
                </span>
              </div>

              <div class="mini-card">
                <span class="mini-icon mint">⌖</span>
                <span class="mini-text">
                  スポット
                  <small>行きたい場所を保存</small>
                </span>
              </div>

              <div class="mini-card">
                <span class="mini-icon blue">♧</span>
                <span class="mini-text">
                  通知
                  <small>必要な情報をまとめて確認</small>
                </span>
              </div>

            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- =========================
         About
    ========================== -->

    <section id="about" class="concept">

      <div class="section-inner">

        <div class="section-heading">
          <div class="label">About Hub Fun!</div>
          <h2>届く情報を、必要な情報へ。</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="concept-box">

          <div class="big-copy">
            「好き」を中心に、<span>情報をひとつに。</span>
          </div>

          <p>
            YouTubeなどの情報、スマートフォンに届く通知、
            イベント、行きたいスポットなど、
            推し活に必要な情報は意外といろいろな場所に散らばっています。
            <br><br>
            Hub Fun! は、そんな情報を自分の「好き」を中心にまとめて、
            必要な情報へすぐアクセスできるようにするアプリです。
          </p>

        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- =========================
         Features
    ========================== -->

    <section id="features">

      <div class="section-inner">

        <div class="section-heading">
          <div class="label">Features</div>
          <h2>Hub Fun! でできること</h2>
          <p>
            推し活に必要な情報を、シンプルにひとつの場所へ。
          </p>
        </div>


        <div class="features">

          <article class="feature">
            <div class="feature-icon">♡</div>
            <h3>推しをまとめる</h3>
            <p>
              好きな人・作品などを登録して、
              自分だけの「推し」一覧を作れます。
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="feature">
            <div class="feature-icon">★</div>
            <h3>イベントを管理</h3>
            <p>
              ライブやイベントなど、
              気になる予定をまとめて確認できます。
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="feature">
            <div class="feature-icon">⌖</div>
            <h3>スポットを保存</h3>
            <p>
              聖地やショップなど、
              行きたい場所をまとめて管理できます。
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="feature">
            <div class="feature-icon">♧</div>
            <h3>通知をまとめる</h3>
            <p>
              スマートフォンに届いた情報を、
              必要なものとしてチェックできます。
            </p>
          </article>

        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- =========================
         Studio
    ========================== -->

    <section id="studio">

      <div class="section-inner">

        <div class="studio-card">

          <div>
            <div class="studio-badge">
              About the Studio
            </div>

            <h2>Hub Fun! Studio</h2>

            <p>
              Hub Fun! Studio は、
              「好きなものを、もっと身近に」をテーマに
              アプリを制作しています。
              <br><br>
              日々の「これがあったら便利かも」を形にしながら、
              楽しく使えるサービスを目指しています。
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="studio-message">
            <strong>
              Make your<br>
              <span>Fun!</span>
            </strong>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- =========================
         Download
    ========================== -->

    <section id="download" class="cta">

      <div class="section-inner">

        <div class="cta-box">

          <h2>
            Hub Fun! と<br>
            推し活をもっと楽しく。
          </h2>

          <p>
            Android向けアプリ「Hub Fun!」
          </p>

          <!-- Google Play公開後にリンク先を設定 -->
          <a
            href="#"
            class="button"
            onclick="return false;"
          >
            Google Play
            （近日公開）
          </a>

        </div>

      </div>

    </section>

  </main>


  <!-- =========================
       Footer
  ========================== -->

  <footer>

    <div class="footer-inner">

      <div>
        <div class="footer-logo">
          Hub <span>Fun!</span> Studio
        </div>

        <div class="copyright">
          © 2026 Hub Fun! Studio
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-links">
        <!-- 公開済みのプライバシーポリシーURLに変更 -->
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
      </div>

    </div>

  </footer>

</body>
</html>
